{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/04af099790434d2ab37214655cc65fe2.avif?t=1762366965\" width=940 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/bc9a8d646aee55059d27da33620f54c5.avif?t=1762366965\" width=400 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redeeming Twisted Beings</strong>: Instead of simply slaying corrupted foes, Amara can purify their souls through redemption. Success depends on enemy health and Amara\u2019s Light level, balancing risk and reward. Redeemed enemies regain their true form, thank her, and may leave behind loot or rare Light scrolls \u2014 adding moral choice and strategy to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presence State</strong>: Enter a heightened magical awareness revealing hidden details in Eldoria \u2014 from traps and weakened walls to echoes of past memories. Presence can be used in combat, draining MP over time, and strengthens with more Light spells. With abilities like <i>Stillness of Being</i>, Amara can slow time while uncovering hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f0a05d373623bd6de606d3ee31ef3b8d.avif?t=1762366965\" width=400 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.poster.avif?t=1762366965\" width=1084 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.webm?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/6d3abe8d9a5e8fd5aafd4e60608b509d.mp4?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Magic, Melee or Archery combat types. Each combat type allows for the ability to attack with 1 elements through elemental magic spells, element enhanced melee weapons and element dipped ammo. There are 12 elements:\u00a0Earth, Fire, Water, Air, Ice, Poison, Electric, Sound, Illusion, Cosmic, Light and Dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in responsive battles where elemental strengths and weaknesses matter. Face creatures like the water-born Squeakle and earthbound Chirpleaf \u2014 or redeem their corrupted forms with Light magic. Every encounter blends moral choice with tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/9c51db26dff558849948d486cc10dad9.avif?t=1762366965\" width=400 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.poster.avif?t=1762366965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.webm?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/5d2857d41c26d176a8cd2a57218b542d.mp4?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the 5-floor dungeon, The Lost Labyrinth, filled with loot, spell scrolls, and hidden dangers. Early areas teach core mechanics, while deeper sections test mastery with stronger foes and rare rewads. Eldoria will expand into an open-world game outside of The Lost Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/75de0f8333b0cb7d5c18a1f5041b5739.avif?t=1762366965\" width=400 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.poster.avif?t=1762366965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.webm?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b2dfb8992218d171f0fb4a2db3726202.mp4?t=1762366965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find weapons, spell scrolls and more as you explore. Stock up on potions like Lesser Health, Minor Energy, and Azure Dew to restore strength in tougher fights.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076910?t=1762366965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/f03adc36e9261d0c96eaeb75f014e9e0d3e2f12c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762366965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/9948f8bac36d6b204d680d854f13d7352ca1cb5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762366965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama